)PANEL KEYLIST(ISRHELP,ISR)
)ATTR DEFAULT(%+_)
/*********************************************************************/
/* PANEL    : MBKPRDH                                                */
/* TITLE    : HELP - PRODUCT PARAMETER CHANGE SETS (PAGE 1)          */
/* CONTINUED: MBKPRDH2 (FIELD NAMES)                                 */
/*-------------------------------------------------------------------*/
/* 2007-02-12 JNB  ORIGINAL                                          */
/* 2009-10-01 AOS  PIR 2009/301 RATE REDUCTIONS                      */
/*********************************************************************/
  % TYPE(TEXT) INTENS(HIGH) COLOR(WHITE) SKIP(ON)
  + TYPE(TEXT) INTENS(LOW)  COLOR(GREEN) SKIP(ON)
  ] TYPE(TEXT) INTENS(HIGH) COLOR(YELLOW) SKIP(ON)
)BODY EXPAND(//) WIDTH(80)
%TUTORIAL -/-/- PRODUCT PARAMETER CHANGE SETS -/-/- TUTORIAL
%Command ===>_ZCMD                                                             +
+
+A%change set+is a group of cards for one product, applied together by
+PRMNT010 on the effective date.  If any card fails validation the%whole+
+set is rejected and appears on the PRMNT01 report for Product Control.
+
]Actions+
+  %A+ Add a new product.  Key the short name; then key every field the new
+      product needs (status, customer type, interest indicators, GL codes).
+      A product that pays interest needs GL-INT-EXPENSE; one that charges
+      interest needs GL-INT-INCOME; every product needs GL-BALANCE-CR.
+  %U+ Update one or more fields.
+  %W+ Withdraw the product (status W, withdraw date = business date).
+  %C+ Close to new business (status N).  Existing accounts unaffected.
+
]Effective date+
+   Today: applied by the next PRMNT01 run (submitted on approval, or the
+   end of day run).  Future: carried forward run to run until due.
+
]Cross-checks made by PRMNT010 after applying the set+
+   Credit tier thresholds ascending, tier 1 threshold zero; unarranged rate
+   not below the arranged rate; CHG-NOTIFY-DAYS at least 14; GL codes
+   present.  The dialog checks those it can see in the set itself.
+
]Four eyes+
+   A second user with approval authority must approve the set (option A).
+   PRMNT010 rejects any card whose requester and approver are the same.
)PROC
  &ZCONT = MBKPRDH2
  &ZUP   = MBKMENUH
)END
